  "privacyNotes": "Runs through WABP host capabilities and uses no external HTTP provider. It also imports stickers that the chat archive already stores for groups in an enabled scope (only stored, unredacted, user-visible stickers; the host checks the scope). Stickers are redistributed privately only to current members of that same scope; admins can remove a sticker permanently with /stickers forget.",
